' Only LocationScene moves anybody (burngfx::scenes). In New Sandez: a save,
' sixty frames, a save — in the place and in a conversation the two differ,
' in a room, the restaurant, the pub, the doctor's and the trader's and while
' paused they are the same file.
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
wait 10
save                     ' 1  the place
wait 60
save                     ' 2  the place, sixty steps on: moved
clickon 248              ' walk to him and talk: LocationScene's dialog
save                     ' 3
wait 60
save                     ' 4  the conversation does not stop the place
esc
mapclick 309,168         ' room 0 (InventoryScene)
save                     ' 5
wait 60
save                     ' 6  = 5
esc
mapclick 375,196         ' the restaurant
save                     ' 7
wait 60
save                     ' 8  = 7
esc
mapclick 309,264         ' the pub
esc                      ' its film (`ImageScene`) first
save                     ' 9
wait 60
save                     ' 10 = 9
esc
mapclick 245,231         ' the doctor
save                     ' 11
wait 60
save                     ' 12 = 11
esc
wait 60
save                     ' 13 out again: the place moves
clickon 248
hire
trade
trade                    ' at the trader's
save                     ' 14
wait 60
save                     ' 15 = 14
esc
save                     ' 16
pause
wait 60
pause                    ' any key ends PauseScene
save                     ' 17 = 16 and one step: see frozen_control.script
